{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23663","headline":"忆庐山旧隐及洛下新居 · 白居易","name":"忆庐山旧隐及洛下新居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"形骸僶俛班行内，骨肉句留俸禄中。\n无奈攀缘随手长，亦知恩爱到头空。\n草堂久闭庐山下，竹院新抛洛水东。\n自是未能归去得，世间谁要白须翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}